---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="font-serif antialiased">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>OC-Free-Model-Video</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --ground: #f2efe8;
        --ink: #0a0a0a;
        --ink-muted: #6b6b6b;
        --ink-soft: #8a8a8a;
        --rule: #1a1a1a14;
        --accent: #2e1a47;
        --muted: #eeeae1;
        --font-display: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --font-serif: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --font-sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji";
        --font-mono: "JetBrainsMono", "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      }

      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html, body {
        background: var(--ground);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-feature-settings: "kern", "liga", "onum";
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        text-rendering: optimizelegibility;
        line-height: 1.5;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      main {
        flex: 1;
        max-width: 56rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 1.6vw, 2.75rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
      }

      section {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
      }

      section:first-child {
        border-top: none;
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      p {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      strong {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      code {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: var(--muted);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
        border-radius: 0.2em;
        font-size: 0.9em;
      }

      pre {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: var(--muted);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        line-height: 1.55;
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }

      ul {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-left: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      li {
        margin: 0.375rem 0;
      }

      a {
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.14s, border-color 0.14s;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      hr {
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --ground: #171410;
          --ink: #e7e2d8;
          --ink-muted: #a39b8d;
          --ink-soft: #837b6f;
          --rule: #f2efe81a;
          --accent: #b3a1d6;
          --muted: #211d18;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>OC-Free-Model-Video</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Use OpenRouter's free router in OpenCode for small coding tasks and experiments.</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Install OpenCode</h2>
        <p>On macOS with Homebrew, run:</p>
        <pre><code>brew install anomalyco/tap/opencode</code></pre>
        <p>If you already have OpenCode, skip this step. Other platforms can use the installation guide.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Connect your OpenRouter key</h2>
        <p>Create an API key at OpenRouter. Then launch OpenCode:</p>
        <pre><code>opencode</code></pre>
        <p>Inside its terminal interface, type <code>/connect</code>, choose <strong>OpenRouter</strong>, and paste the key. OpenCode saves provider credentials separately from your config. See the provider instructions.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Set the free router as your default</h2>
        <p>Search and select it in the model picker.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Test it</h2>
        <p>Exit OpenCode and run:</p>
        <pre><code>opencode models openrouter
opencode run -m openrouter/openrouter/free "Reply with: setup works"</code></pre>
        <p>The model list should include <code>openrouter/openrouter/free</code>. A reply confirms that authentication and routing work. These commands follow the CLI docs.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Use it in a project</h2>
        <p>From your project directory, start:</p>
        <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free</code></pre>
        <p>Try a small task: "Read the README and explain how to run this project." Use <code>/models</code> to switch models later.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>If it fails</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A model-not-found error usually means the model ID or config needs checking. Confirm the full ID above and restart OpenCode.</li>
          <li>For an authentication error, reconnect your OpenRouter key with <code>/connect</code>.</li>
          <li>Free inference still has request limits. A coding task can use several requests. If you get a 429, wait before retrying and follow any retry delay in the error.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Docs checked September 30, 2026.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>